\b0 Zero is a simple module which demonstrates how to build Resound modules.  Its source code is located in the 
\i APIExamples
\i0  directory, and a walk-through building Zero can be found in Resound's on-line help under the category "Building a Resound Module: A Walk-Through".  Zero's operations work for 8-bit linear, 8-bit mulaw, 16-bit linear, floating-point and double-precision floating-point sounds. \
\
